    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T14:38:27Z",
    "body": "I created a branch here that can open a very simple devcontainer in WSL: https://github.com/pupeno/zed/tree/wsl-devcontainers\n\nFull disclosure: this is fully vibe coded, I don't know Rust, and I haven't read the code. I just wanted to try it to see if it would work. Not sure what my next step will be here. I do want to learn Rust, but I'd probably move very slowly with this and happy for anyone to grab this if anyone cares.\n\nThere are other issues with devcontainers that I ran into that I might pick up as well.",
